      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:08",
      "end_timestamp": "01:18",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It just comes and goes. It's worse with standing up and hot weather. I'd call it severe.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:20",
      "end_timestamp": "01:29",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:31",
      "end_timestamp": "01:35",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Nearly passing out goes along with it, most of the time. Hmm, and there's a pounding in the head as well, about two weeks now.",
